  "about_item": [
    "The soft, lightweight rubber basket design provides all-around oral protection: allowing dogs to eat, drink, and pant freely while preventing bites. Ideal for safe handling during socializing, veterinary visits, grooming, or dog travel, the breathable, perforated design allows your dog to pant, drink, and even be fed through the wide opening in the basket muzzle. This design maximizes ventilation to prevent overheating and allows you to give treats.",
    "Comfortable fit design: Available in various sizes to fit all breeds and sizes, featuring an adjustable head and neck strap for quick adjustments to fit your dog perfectly. Ideal for puppies, small, medium, and large breeds.",
    "The basket design of the dog training muzzle fully covers the dog's mouth, preventing them from chewing on dirty food. The wide opening in the muzzle allows your dog to drink through. This design maximizes ventilation to prevent overheating.",
    "Dog-friendly materials: This ergonomic muzzle is made from an innovative thermoplastic elastomer material commonly used in fitness equipment. Therefore, it is not only soft, lightweight, and comfortable, but also durable, environmentally friendly, odorless, and quick and easy to clean. This means you can spend less time cleaning the mouth and nose of small to medium-sized dogs after an adventure, and more time playing with your furry friend.",
    "Available in 4 sizes: suitable for all dogs. Ideal for aggressive and energetic dogs, suitable for use during daily walks, training, grooming, vet visits, public transportation, etc."
  ],
