        "position": 1,
        "title": "Great For My Medium German Shepherd!",
        "text": "We have a mixed breed with a good amount of German Shepherd in him. He is small compared to a regular German Shepherd but compared to most dogs, he's around a medium to large size. I ordered this muzzle for him because he has really bad anxiety. He's actually medicated because it's so bad. He doesn't mind people as long as they aren't in his house. We always have him locked up when our son's friends come over. They are teens. We need to be able to allow our son's friends over without him being locked up because he is part of the family. This muzzle is pretty awesome. It's sturdy. Seems to pretty durable so far. He's currently training with it before we get our sons friends to interact with him. It is also made with holes so the dog can breathe and drink water if he's thirsty. Hopefully here soon, we will be able to test and see if he will be nice to our son's friends. All in all, this is a medium size and I love it. Best muzzle I've ever tried on our dog and he doesn't seem to mind it either!!!",
