      {
        "position": 3,
        "title": "​Comfortable Rubber Design—Great for Safety Walks",
        "text": "I ordered this muzzle as a safety precaution for when we go out to public places where there might be other people or animals. Even though my dog is naturally very calm, respectful, and well-behaved, being a responsible pet owner means always having a muzzle available just in case a situation arises where he might feel threatened or defensive.**Size & Fit for Large Breeds**When I ordered this, only the Large (L) size was available, and the Extra Large (XL) was out of stock. For a big German Shepherd with a large snout, the XL would definitely be the proper choice, so I highly recommend other owners of large breeds to make sure they order the right size. However, even with the Large size, I was surprised by how well it fit. The material is a thick, durable rubber, and the harness adjusted well without squeezing his face.**Dog's Reaction & Comfort**Usually, when they put those cloth muzzles on him at the vet, he gets extremely uncomfortable because they pinch his cheeks. This rubber basket design was a completely different story. Machito stayed very calm and confident while wearing it. It leaves a nice, comfortable space around the nose so it doesn't bother his breathing, and there is a wide opening in the front that allows him to easily stick his tongue out and pant.**Value**The quality of the material is great, it provides excellent ventilation, and most importantly, it didn't make my dog feel trapped or uncomfortable. It is a very reliable tool to keep on hand for daily walks or training sessions.",
